{{!
  Template: likes-expired
  Data keys:
    - name           {string}  Recipient's first name
    - count          {number}  Number of likes that expired
    - expiryDate     {string}  Date when likes expired
    - appUrl         {string}  Base URL of the app
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear    {number}
}}
<p class='email-greeting'>{{#if name}}Update on your sent likes,
    {{name}}
    ⏳{{else}}Update on your sent likes ⏳{{/if}}</p>

<p>
  We wanted to let you know that
  <strong>{{count}}</strong>
  of your pending likes expired on
  <strong>{{expiryDate}}</strong>.
</p>

<div class='email-highlight-box'>
  <p>
    💡
    <strong>Why do likes expire?</strong>
    To keep everyone's experience fresh and relevant, unreciprocated likes
    quietly expire after 90 days. The other person was never told you liked
    them.
  </p>
</div>

<p>
  Your slate is clean! You can explore new connections or re-send likes at any
  time.
</p>

<div style='text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;'>
  <a href='{{appUrl}}' class='email-btn'>Discover New Connections →</a>
</div>

<hr class='email-divider' />

<p style='font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;'>
  Have questions? Visit our
  <a href='{{appUrl}}/faq'>FAQ</a>
  or contact support.
</p>